Here's a JavaScript function that accepts text and posts a message via the Slack API to the specified channel:

```javascript
function postToSlack(text, channel) {
  const webhookUrl = `https://hooks.slack.com/services/${channel}/${process.env.SLACK_API_KEY}`;
  fetch(webhookUrl, {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: {
      'Content-Type': 'application/json',
    },
    body: JSON.stringify({
      text,
    }),
  })
    .then((response) => response.json())
    .catch((error) => console.error(error));
}
```

Make sure to replace `process.env.SLACK_API_KEY` with your actual Slack API key.

