        double co2EmissionRate = 0.8; // pounds of CO2 emitted per gallon of fuel
        double co2Emissions = co2EmissionRate * fuelConsumption; // pounds of CO2 emitted
        System.out.println("CO2 emissions from burning fossil fuels: " + co2Emissions + " lbs");
    }
}
```

2. Deforestation: Trees absorb CO2 from the atmosphere during photosynthesis. When forests are cleared, this carbon storage is lost, leading to an increase in atmospheric CO2 levels.

